      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To submit an audio file for batch transcription, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Amazon Transcribe is a suitable choice for this task. I will write the Python file `submit_transcription.py` that uses the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Transcribe. This will make the provider identifiable in the code through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of Amazon Transcribe specific methods. </thinking>\n",
